Use stubbing when you have verified the interactions with the dependent class and want to test alternate paths through your code. Stubbing is similar to mocking but does not provide the ability to verify method calls.

### Generating Mocks and Stubs
You can generate mocks and stubs using a mocking framework such as `unittest.mock` in Python.

