<p>How can I achieve the same behavior with <code>ngIf else</code>?</p>

Answers:
```python
def compare_variables(x, y, z):
    mylist = []
    if (x or y or z == 0) and (x or y or z == 1) and (x or y or z == 2):
        return None
    elif x == 0 and y == 1 and z == 2:
